        <!-- v6.0.0 -->
        <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 border-primary-600/30 space-y-4 shadow-lg bg-primary-50/10 dark:bg-primary-950/20">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-primary-600/10 dark:border-primary-500/20 pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">v6.0.0</span>
                    <span class="badge-teal">Latest Major Release</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">September 14, 2026</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300">Major Architectural Overhaul</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-primary-600">
                    <li><strong>TypeScript 5.x Native ESM</strong>: Complete rewrite in modern TypeScript with strict type checking, full native ES modules (<code>"type": "module"</code>), and generated declaration maps.</li>
                    <li><strong>Layered Architecture</strong>: Clean decoupling into <code>core/</code> (pure models, errors, tokens, events), <code>db/</code> (adapters, dialects, repositories, retries), <code>services/</code> (domain logic), <code>oauth/</code> (provider-neutral engine &amp; presets), <code>express/</code> (router adapters), and <code>http/</code> (routes, middleware, sessions, response envelopes).</li>
                    <li><strong>Provider-Neutral OAuth 2.0 &amp; OIDC</strong>: Modern social and enterprise identity engine supporting Google, GitHub, Microsoft/Entra ID, Discord, Apple, and Custom OIDC. Features automatic discovery via <code>/.well-known/openid-configuration</code>, remote JWKS validation with <code>jose</code>, default-on PKCE (RFC 7636), and AES-256-GCM token encryption at rest.</li>
                    <li><strong>Decoupled Authentication &amp; Authorization</strong>: Unified <code>AuthContext</code> domain model across session cookies, Bearer tokens, and OAuth alongside pure <code>AuthorizationService</code> for policy evaluation.</li>
                    <li><strong>Dynamic Manifest Permission Engine</strong>: Declarative <code>app:service:action</code> permission catalogs via <code>definePermissions</code>, automated database synchronization via <code>syncAppPermissions</code>, <code>RoleRegistry</code> with wildcard matching, and drop-in middleware (<code>sessPerm</code>, <code>permChk</code>).</li>
                    <li><strong>Cryptographic TokenEngine</strong>: Standardized prefixed tokens (<code>mbk_pat_</code>, <code>mbk_cli_</code>, <code>mbk_dev_</code>, <code>mbk_sess_</code>) with constant-time SHA-256 verification and last-used tracking.</li>
                    <li><strong>Domain Event Streaming</strong>: Type-safe <code>authEvents</code> emitter for login, logout, token creation, CLI authorization, and OAuth security alerts.</li>
                    <li><strong>Dual-Database Resilience &amp; Retries</strong>: Transparent query retry with exponential backoff and jitter (<code>dbRetry</code>), <code>SqliteMutex</code> for conflict-free SQLite concurrency, and live dev query logging (<code>dbQueryLogger</code>).</li>
                    <li><strong>Subpath Package Exports</strong>: Modular subpaths for <code>mbkauthe</code>, <code>mbkauthe/core</code>, <code>mbkauthe/db</code>, <code>mbkauthe/repositories</code>, <code>mbkauthe/services</code>, <code>mbkauthe/oauth</code>, <code>mbkauthe/oauth/presets</code>, <code>mbkauthe/express</code>, <code>mbkauthe/middleware</code>, <code>mbkauthe/response</code>, <code>mbkauthe/diagnostics</code>, and <code>mbkauthe/config</code>.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- v5.6.0 -->
        <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 border-primary-600/20 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-primary-600/10 dark:border-primary-500/20 pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">v5.6.0</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">August 20, 2026</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300">Added</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-primary-600">
                    <li><strong>Dual-Database SQLite Support</strong>: Complete SQLite (<code>better-sqlite3</code>) support alongside PostgreSQL with runtime SQL translation via <code>translatePgToSqlite</code>.</li>
                    <li><strong><code>BaseRepository</code> Pattern</strong>: Driver-agnostic base repository with transactional helpers (<code>withTransaction</code>).</li>
                    <li><strong>RFC 8628 CLI Device Flow</strong>: Authorization verification links and token polling endpoints.</li>
                    <li><strong>Graceful Pool Shutdown</strong>: Centralized <code>registerGracefulShutdown</code> and <code>closeAllConnections</code>.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

